    "id": "143115a2b43a42f483db8cb0b3aa0a75b68e1d94",
    "message": "wp433 N: dong bon no tren duong ghi credential cua tl_gws.py\n\nDac ta GWS-CRED-DICH-NGOAI-KHO-N r1 (sha256 fa48e076...), lease wp433-r6-g1-claude.\n\n- M1 fragment packet 1: hai phep so cua N8.4-W2/N8.4-W6 so sau normcase(normpath) hai ve\n  (W2: startswith ban chuan hoa cong os.sep; W6: bang nhau). Tren nt expanduser giu dau \"/\"\n  nen phep so chuoi cu luon sai va os.replace khong bao gio nem.\n- M2 them _chot_thu_muc: chi luat lien ket, moi tien to tu goc toi thu muc; khong kiem .git,\n  khong tao/ghi. Goi sau dong chot W6 va cuoi _dich_jar_nlm (W1-W3). os.getcwd chi goi cho\n  duong tuong doi; duong quy ve goc chi lstat goc (nt: sau khi do loai o).\n- M3 bundle giai ma khong phai dict: bootstrap va nlm-auth-pull tra 3, mot dong stderr,\n  truoc moi phep gan env / ghi tep / nhanh agent.\n- M4 _trong_kho_git ba trang thai: chi FileNotFoundError/NotADirectoryError la \"chua co\";\n  loi lstat khac lan ra.\n- M5 fragment moi wp433_gws_cred_no: 3 ca, 27 luot, 5 dot bien (bang 4b), 3 tu kiem phan hang,\n  phan chung bo do pc_doc_truoc.\n- M6 bundled tai sinh bang generate_bundled_module_bytes; khong sua tay; khong dung manifest.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxrYHj99ouz26BYSzaob",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-20T02:44:59Z",
    "tree_id": "3b200640563c8673fa7faebdc49a41b3028061ee"
   },
